  "description": "Cold email outreach engine: sequences and steps, enrollments, mailboxes with warm-up and hourly caps, a send-window scheduler, reply matching and classification, send and read audits, and contacts, as EF Core entities with their mappings and table scripts. Opt-outs and bounces go through the Webority.Email suppression store. The product owns the DbContext, the migrations and the hosts, and supplies the mail provider (Webority.Email.Outreach.Graph), the step queue and the AI seams.",
